  "Behandeling bij Andres": "Treatment with Andres",
  "Behandeling bij Iris": "Treatment with Iris",
  "Behandeling & productadvies": "Treatment & product advice",
  "Advies & behandeling": "Advice & treatment",
  "Diverse behandelingen": "Various treatments",
  Skinbehandeling: "Skin treatment",
  Peeling: "Peel",
  "Consult peeling": "Peel consultation",
  "Consult bij Grissel": "Consultation with Grissel",
  "Consult & behandeling": "Consultation & treatment",
  "Huidscan & consult bij Andres": "Skin scan & consultation with Andres",
  "Laserontharing bij Demi": "Laser hair removal with Demi",
  Laserbehandeling: "Laser treatment",
  "Laserbehandeling bij Demi": "Laser treatment with Demi",
