    "The therapist chooses the range, the strength and the working time based on your skin, your health, the area and the goal of the treatment.",
  "Per klacht staat erbij welke behandeling hiervoor wordt ingezet. Welke bij jou past, stelt de huidtherapeut tijdens de intake vast.":
    "Per concern it says which treatment is used for it. Which one suits you is established by the skin therapist at the intake.",
  "Meerdere apparaten hier doen op het oog hetzelfde. Welke je krijgt hangt af van je huid en van wat er gemeten is. Hieronder staat waarin ze van elkaar verschillen.":
    "Several devices here do the same thing to the eye. Which one you get depends on your skin and on what was measured. Below is how they differ from one another.",
