  "Welk apparaat bij jou past,": "Which device suits you,",
  "hoor je in het consult": "sessions at the consult",
  "Een huidtherapeut kijkt naar je huid, meet mee met de EVE-M en vertelt welke behandeling erbij past, hoe vaak je moet komen en wat het kost. Dertig minuten,":
    "A skin therapist looks at your skin, measures with the EVE-M and tells you which treatment fits, how often you need to come and what it costs. Thirty minutes,",
  ", en je beslist daarna zelf.": ", and you decide for yourself afterwards.",
