    "Treating ingrown hairs with laser hair removal. If there is a hair in the bump, hair removal tackles it at the root.",
  "Keloid en verdikte littekens in Rotterdam":
    "Keloids and raised scars in Rotterdam",
  "Het verschil tussen een keloid en een verdikt litteken, wat wij behandelen en wat via je arts loopt.":
    "The difference between a keloid and a raised scar, what we treat and what goes through your doctor.",
  "Keratosis pilaris behandelen": "Treating keratosis pilaris",
