    "Treating keratosis pilaris with peels and targeted care that dissolves the build-up of keratin around the follicle.",
  "Littekens en striae behandelen in Rotterdam":
    "Treating scars and stretch marks in Rotterdam",
  "Littekens en striae behandelen met microneedling en laser. Rode littekens reageren doorgaans het beste; bij witte richten we ons op de structuur.":
    "Treating scars and stretch marks with microneedling and laser. Red scars usually respond best; with white ones we focus on the texture.",
  "Melasma behandelen in Rotterdam": "Treating melasma in Rotterdam",
  "Melasma behandelen met peelings, verzorging en zonbescherming. Hoe diep het pigment zit bepaalt wat mogelijk is, en dat zien we onder UV-scan beginnen.":
    "Treating melasma with peels, care and sun protection. How deep the pigment sits decides what is possible, and we see that start under a UV scan.",
  "Moedervlekken weghalen": "Having moles removed",
