    "Microneedling for scars after surgery or a caesarean. When you can start, what changes and when a doctor looks first.",
  "Microneedling bij striae. Waarom rode striae beter reageren dan witte, en wat er wel en niet verandert.":
    "Microneedling for stretch marks. Why red stretch marks respond better than white ones, and what does and does not change.",
  "Medische peelings bij acne in Rotterdam. Welk zuur waarvoor werkt, waarom je huid eerst onrustiger kan worden, en hoe vaak.":
    "Medical peels for acne in Rotterdam. Which acid works on what, why your skin can become more unsettled first, and how often.",
